{
  "id": "c1-e16-prevention-in-health-care",
  "level": "C1",
  "version": 1,
  "topic": "Prevention in health care",
  "parts": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "title": "Interview",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p1-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Good afternoon. First of all, we'd like to know a little about you.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e16-prevention-in-health-care/p1-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4500
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q1",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "text": "Candidate A, how much attention do you pay to your health?",
          "durationSec": 25,
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e16-prevention-in-health-care/p1-q1.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4200
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q2",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "text": "Candidate B, what do you think is the biggest health problem in your country?",
          "durationSec": 25,
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e16-prevention-in-health-care/p1-q2.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5300
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q3",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "text": "Candidate A, how easy is it to see a doctor where you live?",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e16-prevention-in-health-care/p1-q3.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4400
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q4",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "text": "Candidate B, do you trust information about health that you find online?",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e16-prevention-in-health-care/p1-q4.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5500
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "title": "Long turn",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p2-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "In this part of the test, I'm going to give each of you three pictures. I'd like you to talk about two of them on your own for about a minute, and also to answer a question briefly about your partner's pictures.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e16-prevention-in-health-care/p2-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 13200
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-a",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "assets": [
            "c1-e16-a1",
            "c1-e16-a2",
            "c1-e16-a3"
          ],
          "text": "Candidate A, your pictures show people dealing with health. Choose two of the pictures and say what the people might be worried about, and how effective these approaches to health might be.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e16-prevention-in-health-care/p2-a.mp3",
          "audioMs": 12000
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-a-follow",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "text": "Candidate B, which of these do you think is the best way to stay healthy?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e16-prevention-in-health-care/p2-a-follow.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5100
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-b",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "assets": [
            "c1-e16-b1",
            "c1-e16-b2",
            "c1-e16-b3"
          ],
          "text": "Candidate B, your pictures show health care in different forms. Choose two of the pictures and say what the advantages of these services might be, and what limitations there could be.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e16-prevention-in-health-care/p2-b.mp3",
          "audioMs": 12200
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-b-follow",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "text": "Candidate A, would you be happy to see a doctor online?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e16-prevention-in-health-care/p2-b-follow.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4100
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "title": "Collaborative task",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p3-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Now I'd like you to talk about something together for about two minutes. Here are some measures that could improve public health, and a question for you to discuss.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e16-prevention-in-health-care/p3-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 10200
        },
        {
          "id": "p3-discuss",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 120,
          "diagram": "c1-e16-prevention-in-health-care",
          "text": "Talk to each other about this question: How might these measures improve the health of a population?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e16-prevention-in-health-care/p3-discuss.mp3",
          "audioMs": 7000
        },
        {
          "id": "p3-decide",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "diagram": "c1-e16-prevention-in-health-care",
          "text": "Now you have about a minute to decide together. Which would be the most effective in the long term?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e16-prevention-in-health-care/p3-decide.mp3",
          "audioMs": 6700
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "title": "Discussion",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p4-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Now I'd like to ask you some more questions about health care and prevention.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e16-prevention-in-health-care/p4-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5200
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q1",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 50,
          "text": "Should prevention receive more government money than treatment?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e16-prevention-in-health-care/p4-q1.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4200
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q2",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate A, to what extent are individuals responsible for their own health?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e16-prevention-in-health-care/p4-q2.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5700
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q3",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate B, do you think wearable technology will improve people's health or just make them more anxious?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e16-prevention-in-health-care/p4-q3.mp3",
          "audioMs": 7400
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q4",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 50,
          "text": "Is it fair for people with unhealthy lifestyles to receive free medical care?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e16-prevention-in-health-care/p4-q4.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5600
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q5",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate A, how can health services cope with growing demand?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e16-prevention-in-health-care/p4-q5.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4700
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q6",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate B, should some medical information be kept private even if it could help science?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e16-prevention-in-health-care/p4-q6.mp3",
          "audioMs": 6200
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
